    "detailed_description": "This is a wonderful puzzle platformer 3D that you never saw before! <br>Here you are a Bottle Glass that enjoys Hip Hop and needs to fill his body to go through a rescue mission to reunite with his Best friend, the Corky DOG! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/cc2eed63d9e906004ab82b8fe8bf9ac2.poster.avif?t=1742002166\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/cc2eed63d9e906004ab82b8fe8bf9ac2.webm?t=1742002166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/cc2eed63d9e906004ab82b8fe8bf9ac2.mp4?t=1742002166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It's too much love and lots of break dance! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/d569d14e9587a93584164b2d3f49cfdc.poster.avif?t=1742002166\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/d569d14e9587a93584164b2d3f49cfdc.webm?t=1742002166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/d569d14e9587a93584164b2d3f49cfdc.mp4?t=1742002166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Although, you'll need to solve lots of math and logical puzzles to do this!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/69ff8886720120a99253532e50461cae.poster.avif?t=1742002166\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/69ff8886720120a99253532e50461cae.webm?t=1742002166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/69ff8886720120a99253532e50461cae.mp4?t=1742002166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>If you want, you can collect photos, and change them at the Store!!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/5d6e0f5e63e1faf7cd8e89cf16500252.poster.avif?t=1742002166\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/5d6e0f5e63e1faf7cd8e89cf16500252.webm?t=1742002166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/5d6e0f5e63e1faf7cd8e89cf16500252.mp4?t=1742002166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Jump into this rescue mission!! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/ff6ce7627bec09e976d91e053b042d7e.poster.avif?t=1742002166\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/ff6ce7627bec09e976d91e053b042d7e.webm?t=1742002166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066430/extras/ff6ce7627bec09e976d91e053b042d7e.mp4?t=1742002166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
